@Newsletter.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5081

### 1) null sneaks into a non-nullable string (201 before the fix, 400 after)
POST {{Newsletter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subscribers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": null, "firstName": "Stefan" }

### 2) the null is now stored
GET {{Newsletter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subscribers

### 3) a DIFFERENT request crashes on the stored null (500 before the fix, 400 after)
POST {{Newsletter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subscribers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ana" }

### 4) valid request (201)
POST {{Newsletter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subscribers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "Ana@Example.com ", "firstName": "Ana" }

### 5) articles
POST {{Newsletter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Pragmatic rules", "content": "Let the build enforce it." }

###
GET {{Newsletter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/articles
